cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Framework to Automatically Determine the Quality of Open Data Catalogs"
abstract: >
  An automated framework for evaluating the quality of open data catalogs
  across multiple dimensions including accuracy, completeness, consistency,
  scalability, timeliness, provenance, readability, and licensing. The
  framework is implemented in Python and operates on RDF/Turtle-encoded
  data catalogs.
